# Dawn palette: the same keys as night-school.pal, for the escape / ending
# moments. Night indigo becomes purple and rose at the horizon, moonlight
# turns into warm morning light. Keep the keys identical to night-school.pal.
K 1a1220 outline, purple-black
D 3c2a4e high sky purple
N 6a3e64 mauve
U b25a5c rose at the horizon
u e08a62 orange
M f2c38a warm light
W e8d8c0 pale warm
w fff2dc bright
G 3e4a3a moss dark
g 5e6e4c moss
p 5a3a2e wood dark
P 8a5a3e wood
s f0c0a0 skin
h c08870 skin shadow
H 2e2026 hair
R d84a3a accent red
r 8a2a26 accent red dark
Y ffe08a sunlight
C a8e8d8 spirit (pale)
c 5aa8a0 spirit dark
S 4b3959 occult shade (blend of D and w)
V a34848 bruise violet (blend of U and r)
m dd7354 rose (blend of u and R)
n 8e656d plaster deep shadow (blend of N and Y)
b a8998b plaster shadow (blend of W and H)
o a77c51 wood light (blend of P and Y)
q bf5551 skin deep shadow (blend of U and R)
O ea8e5e candle flame (blend of R and Y)
L fff0d2 flame core (blend of w and Y)
